OL,3,ANigerian film star Ogogo dies from
OL,4,Acancer aged 66
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigeria's huge film industry,
OL,7,FNollywood, is in mourning after the
OL,8,Fdeath at 66 of veteran actor and star
OL,9,Fof Yoruba-language cinema Taiwo Hassan,
OL,10,Fpopularly known as Ogogo.
OL,12,FHis daughter, Kira Hassan, confirmed
OL,13,Fthe news during an emotional Instagram
OL,14,Flive broadcast on Sunday, where she
OL,15,Fstruggled to come to terms with her
OL,16,Ffather's death.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
