OL,3,ANigerian film star Ogogo dies from
OL,4,Acancer aged 66
OL,5,
OL,6,FOgogo, who had been suffering from
OL,7,Fcancer, is due to be buried on Monday
OL,8,Fin his hometown in Ogun state,
OL,9,Fsouth-west Nigeria, in line with Muslim
OL,10,Ftradition, according to fellow actor
OL,11,FPrince Jide Kosoko.
OL,13,FColleagues and fans have been paying
OL,14,Ftribute to a man who became one of
OL,15,FYoruba cinema's most recognisable
OL,16,Ffaces.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
